  "withdrawal_conditions": [
    "Residual property or market mechanisms repeatedly recreate rent, inherited concentration, productive control or essential veto.",
    "A reserve exists in accounts but is inaccessible under shock or shares a critical failure with its supposed backup.",
    "A decision attributes privilege or guilt to collective identity rather than demonstrated mechanism and evidence.",
    "A critical ecological buffer is destroyed while a feasible protective alternative exists.",
    "Affected people cannot contest their category, evidence or exposure decision."
